0..64 Comment "// This source defines non-session effects of a domhringr stage."
65..67 Comment "//"
68..145 Comment "// A row names each effect instance. A session remains a linear channel type."
146..148 Comment "//"
149..216 Comment "// The commutation rules state which operations fusion may reorder."
217..286 Comment "// A commutation past an operation that answers a value is a law over"
287..362 Comment "// continuations. An effect that commutes with nothing has no law to write."
363..365 Comment "//"
366..451 Comment "// - see: `../../pathological/effects/domhringr.gandr` — invalid continuation ports"
